# Grievio Root Environment Reference Guide
# Grievio uses isolated environment files per service:
#
# 1. Backend API:
#    See backend/.env.example
#    Variables: DB_ENGINE, DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, SECRET_KEY, DEBUG, CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS
#
# 2. Web Client:
#    See web/.env.example
#    Variables: VITE_API_BASE_URL, VITE_APP_NAME
#
# 3. Mobile App (Expo):
#    See mobile/.env.example
#    Variables: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL, EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_NAME

